# title: Ctrl+W on a dirty tab asks to save; 取消 keeps the tab and the disk file
# checklist: A6
# timeout: 150
open:$V\tab-a.md
uclick:~alpha file
key:end
type: dirty
ms:400
key:ctrl+w
ms:1200
uia:A6.prompt-shown|有未保存的修改
uia:A6.prompt-buttons|不保存(N)@Button
uia:A6.prompt-names-file|~要保存吗
shot:prompt
uclick:取消@Button
ms:800
nouia:A6.prompt-closed|有未保存的修改
uia:A6.tab-still-open|~tab-a.md@TabItem
fileeq:A6.disk-untouched|tab-a.md|# Tab A\n\nalpha file\n
